### 간편장부 목록 조회 (기본)
GET {{baseUrl}}/book-entries?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 간편장부 목록 조회 (확인된 항목만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/book-entries?confirmed=true&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 간편장부 목록 조회 (미확인 항목만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/book-entries?confirmed=false&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 간편장부 항목 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/book-entries/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 미확인 항목 수 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/book-entries/unconfirmed-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 간편장부 요약 조회 (연도별)
GET {{baseUrl}}/book-entries/summary?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
